CLI for the Antithesis API

Usage: snouty [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  launch             Launch a test run
  runs               Interact with test runs
  debug              Launch a debugging session
  completions        Output shell completions
  validate           Validate local Antithesis setup
  doctor             Check environment configuration
  version            Print version information
  update             Check for and install updates
  docs               Search Antithesis documentation
  settings           Show snouty's settings, and trust or deny a project
                     settings file
  login              Sign in and store your snouty configuration
  docker-credential  Give Docker or Podman the credential for the tenant's
                     container registry
  help               Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
      --json                 Output JSON where supported (NDJSON for list/stream
                             commands, pretty JSON otherwise)
      --verbose              Log API requests to stderr (authentication tokens
                             redacted)
      --settings <SETTINGS>  Path to the snouty settings file (default:
                             ./.snouty.toml; overrides SNOUTY_SETTINGS_PATH)
      --profile <PROFILE>    Settings profile to select (overrides
                             ANTITHESIS_PROFILE)
